TELEWIRE - README, LICENSE AGREEMENT, TERMS & CONDITIONS, AND PRIVACY POLICY
================================================================================

README / ABOUT TELEWIRE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TeleWire is a high-performance desktop download manager for Telegram.
It connects directly to Telegram via MTProto to pull files straight to disk
over parallel connections — with pause, resume, queue management, and crash-safe
chunk recovery.

Key Features:
- Direct MTProto Client: No middleman server, no bot, no proxy relay.
- Parallel Chunked Downloads: Splits files into 512 KiB chunks over parallel connections.
- Crash-Safe Resume: Progress is flushed to disk sidecar manifests; resumes seamlessly.
- Smart Organization: Automatically organizes downloads by chat, date, and media type.
- Zero Telemetry: 100% private, no analytics, no tracking, and no external calls.

Full documentation, source code, and release notes:
https://github.com/SasmithaKRandunu/telewire


